## Docs impact map (quick lookup)

When you change… you must review/update…

- **Any `src/irswitch/` behavior, files, or boundaries**
  - matching `docs/dokumentace/domeny/<balík>.md`
  - `docs/dokumentace/mapa-souboru.md` and `architektura.md` when files or data flow change
  - `docs/dokumentace/inflight/` when it exists only on an open PR

- **Config keys / defaults / behavior**
  - `CONFIG.md`
  - `config/config.example.ini`
  - `docs/dokumentace/domeny/config.md`
  - (if distro impacted) `BUILD_AND_DEPLOY.md`

- **CLI flags / run instructions / startup scripts**
  - `README.md`
  - `start_app.ps1` / `run_tests.*` references (if changed)

- **API endpoints / payloads / dashboards’ JS calls**
  - `API.md`
  - `docs/dokumentace/domeny/server.md`

- **Build / distribution / installer / shortcuts / autostart**
  - `BUILD_AND_DEPLOY.md`
  - `README.md` (Quick Start section if user-facing)

- **Release process / versioning / tags**
  - `RELEASE_POLICY.md`
  - `VERSIONING.md` / `README_VERSIONING.md` (if relevant)
  - `.release-please-manifest.json` must stay in lockstep with `pyproject.toml`

- **Overlay HUD / V4 renderer / Pit Wall art**
  - `docs/dokumentace/domeny/overlay.md`
  - `assets/overlay/themes/docs/overlay_v4_layout_sizing_motion_spec.md`
  - `assets/overlay/themes/docs/PIT_WALL.md` (theme packs)
  - `src/irswitch/web/overlay/GOLDEN_V4.md` (golden fixtures)

- **Commentary product / graph / TTS**
  - `docs/dokumentace/domeny/commentary.md`
  - `COMMENTARY_ENGINE.md`

- **Commentary LoRA / polish datasets / eval tapes**
  - `docs/commentary_lora_dataset.md`
  - private sibling `ir-commentary-lora` (`DATASETS.md`, not this public repo)

- **Cursor automation (rules / skills / commands / agents)**
  - `.cursor/README.md`
  - `AGENTS.md` / `.cursorrules` when Cloud/flow defaults change
  - `docs/dokumentace/README.md` + `jak-cist.md` lookup row for agent flow

PRs must include a “Docs impact” checklist (see `02-work-item-definition.mdc`) including `docs/dokumentace/`.
